WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.510
It's 2:14 AM.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.420
A tenant in Unit 4B has a leak.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:12.210
PropAgent answers on the first ring, and understands exactly what's wrong.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:15.650
It sends the right plumber, inside your spending limit.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.990
Then keeps your tenant in the loop.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.440
By morning, you get a summary. Not a crisis.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.450
Calls. Maintenance. Showings. Rent. Every task, every hour.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:31.090
PropAgent. The property manager that never clocks out.
